WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 22]

01:34.560 --> 01:36.839
Do you plan to stand there all day long?

01:38.640 --> 01:40.639
Don't pull a long face.

01:41.119 --> 01:42.440
Young man,

01:42.800 --> 01:44.320
you can't afford to be down.

01:45.360 --> 01:46.759
Someone reported you to me.

01:46.879 --> 01:49.039
Was it about me silencing someone?

01:49.679 --> 01:50.960
I've heard about it.

01:59.119 --> 02:00.279
Did you do it?

02:00.879 --> 02:02.479
Would you arrest me

02:03.080 --> 02:04.559
if I did do it?

02:06.830 --> 02:09.400
If you wanted to sacrifice your family
for the greater good,

02:09.920 --> 02:12.000
you shouldn't have come here.

02:12.679 --> 02:15.919
If you wished to abuse your power
and go above the law,

02:16.360 --> 02:18.680
all the more reason
why you shouldn't be here.

02:19.160 --> 02:21.120
People might accuse you.

02:21.480 --> 02:23.799
You might be implicated.

02:27.559 --> 02:29.759
If you did commit the crime,

02:31.160 --> 02:32.759
I have to arrest you personally.

02:33.480 --> 02:35.039
If so, I won't be able to face Wan'er.

02:36.839 --> 02:38.710
However, if I abuse my power
to help you out,

02:40.279 --> 02:41.840
I won't be able to face myself.

02:44.640 --> 02:46.160
You're still

02:46.679 --> 02:48.919
not ruthless enough.

02:50.279 --> 02:51.759
So, did you do it?

02:56.040 --> 02:58.400
The spring exam last year,

02:58.850 --> 03:01.239
regarding the name replacement
of one of the scholars,

03:04.519 --> 03:07.199
I think I have some impression of it.

03:07.239 --> 03:08.460
You think?

03:08.480 --> 03:10.720
After all, it wasn't a huge deal.

03:10.999 --> 03:13.880
I didn't need to make
an appearance myself.

03:15.040 --> 03:17.499
So, were you the one
who arranged for his death?

03:17.519 --> 03:18.720
No.

03:21.600 --> 03:24.400
Governing a nation
is just like cooking a small fish.

03:24.480 --> 03:25.919
How could you keep it small

03:25.959 --> 03:27.880
if you kill people
under your governance?

03:28.679 --> 03:29.959
It's not worth it.

03:30.600 --> 03:33.620
So you think
that they're slandering you?

03:33.640 --> 03:35.079
Not necessarily.

03:35.999 --> 03:38.400
I've been in the officialdom
for many years.

03:38.560 --> 03:40.499
I have too many proteges
and allies for me to count.

03:40.519 --> 03:42.170
I couldn't even recognize all of them.

03:42.190 --> 03:44.950
It's hard to distinguish between
the good and the bad at such a number.

03:45.200 --> 03:46.919
And, there will always be bad ones

03:47.399 --> 03:48.680
and dumb ones.

03:50.880 --> 03:53.160
Back then, these people were in charge

03:53.160 --> 03:54.479
of the spring exam.

03:54.519 --> 03:57.359
If the murder did occur,
you may start by investigating them.

03:57.600 --> 03:59.280
Maybe you'll get the result you want.

03:59.560 --> 04:00.740
Are you sure it wasn't you?

04:00.760 --> 04:02.280
It's definitely not me.

04:06.625 --> 04:09.045
[Song Boxiang, Gu Yingzhou,
Lu Anzhong, Fan Yujing]

04:09.640 --> 04:11.979
Did the victim seek you out personally?

04:11.999 --> 04:13.079
Yes.

04:14.760 --> 04:18.800
His Majesty just handed
the investigation of the past spring exams

04:18.800 --> 04:20.120
to you not long ago,

04:20.480 --> 04:22.759
and now, a murder case
came knocking on your doorstep.

04:25.960 --> 04:27.759
What a coincidence, huh?

04:36.800 --> 04:38.639
If that's the case,

04:39.800 --> 04:41.920
these names

04:45.960 --> 04:47.639
might not suffice.

04:49.119 --> 04:51.000
This case has wide
and deep implications.

04:51.319 --> 04:53.599
We'll escort you
to the Court of Judicial Review later.

04:53.759 --> 04:54.900
Once you're there,

04:54.920 --> 04:56.380
they'll ask you the same questions.

04:56.400 --> 04:57.340
Remember,

04:57.360 --> 04:59.619
there's no need to panic
on the Court of Judicial Review.

04:59.639 --> 05:00.800
Don't overthink it.

05:00.870 --> 05:03.440
The Imperial Inspectorate
will uphold justice for you two.

05:03.520 --> 05:04.419
Understood?

05:04.439 --> 05:05.719
Yes, sir.

05:06.759 --> 05:08.120
Yes, sir.

05:42.920 --> 05:45.419
What's the point of doing this?

05:45.439 --> 05:47.320
I have nothing to do anyway.

06:09.439 --> 06:10.519
Mr. Chen.

06:11.520 --> 06:12.880
Ruohai, you're here.

06:13.200 --> 06:14.519
Do you need anything?

06:16.840 --> 06:20.000
I assume you've heard about the case
Fan Xian is investigating.

06:20.040 --> 06:21.120
Yes.

06:22.030 --> 06:24.440
Lin Ruofu has been
the prime minister for many years.

06:24.600 --> 06:26.040
He has plenty of proteges.

06:26.840 --> 06:29.560
Youngsters aren't influential enough
to investigate him.

06:30.600 --> 06:32.680
The words you said just now,

06:33.079 --> 06:34.800
he said the same thing when he was here.

06:36.360 --> 06:37.619
We almost said

06:37.639 --> 06:39.320
the same sentence in the same manner.

06:39.559 --> 06:40.759
Continue.

06:41.079 --> 06:43.880
Lin Ruofu is Fan Xian's
future father-in-law.

06:44.439 --> 06:45.619
No matter what,

06:45.639 --> 06:47.639
we shouldn't let Fan Xian
investigate him.

06:47.840 --> 06:49.340
No matter what the result will be,

06:49.360 --> 06:51.979
Fan Xian won't be able
to deal with the consequences.

06:51.999 --> 06:53.700
I said that too.

06:53.720 --> 06:54.979
What else did you say?

06:54.999 --> 06:56.279
In my opinion,

06:56.480 --> 06:59.519
shouldn't we let another person
investigate Prime Minister Lin instead?

07:05.450 --> 07:06.619
There's no one else.

07:06.639 --> 07:07.880
What are you saying?

07:08.040 --> 07:10.920
Look at you. You have so much free time
that you're playing with ropes.

07:15.400 --> 07:16.519
Let me do it.

07:17.199 --> 07:18.180
Hand the case to me.

07:18.200 --> 07:20.000
I'll take it on the children's behalf.

07:20.160 --> 07:22.000
Why are you doing this to yourself?

07:22.040 --> 07:23.920
He's not your son.

07:26.600 --> 07:28.780
You want him to take over
the Imperial Inspectorate.

07:28.800 --> 07:30.179
As their elders,

07:30.199 --> 07:32.380
we should be protective of them.

07:32.400 --> 07:33.680
I think that works.

07:34.160 --> 07:35.880
You're from the Ministry of Revenue.

07:35.920 --> 07:37.979
Stay out of our affairs.

07:37.999 --> 07:39.659
You won't be able to take on the case.

07:39.679 --> 07:40.659
But why?

07:40.679 --> 07:42.400
He designated Fan Xian
to investigate the case.

07:42.400 --> 07:44.680
Isn't it the same no matter
who investigates the case?

07:45.360 --> 07:48.099
The Imperial Inspectorate's work
isn't child's play, you know?

07:48.119 --> 07:50.099
You want Fan Xian
to investigate Lin Ruofu.

07:50.119 --> 07:51.500
Aren't you messing around yourself?

07:51.520 --> 07:52.959
You have a point.

07:56.079 --> 07:58.120
You two are playing off
of each other, huh?

07:58.280 --> 07:59.820
We're trying to be reasonable here.

07:59.840 --> 08:01.380
It's simple.

08:01.400 --> 08:04.320
Fan Xian has to be the one
investigating the case.

08:05.319 --> 08:07.240
Heaven's grace is abundant.

08:07.559 --> 08:09.240
You two should understand.

08:13.360 --> 08:14.719
When it comes to this case,

08:14.879 --> 08:16.279
no one can save him.

08:46.959 --> 08:48.400
Do you want a bowl of wontons?

08:48.599 --> 08:49.959
They're freshly made.

08:52.000 --> 08:53.280
Here, have a seat.

08:54.640 --> 08:56.640
Wontons for sale.

09:05.599 --> 09:09.320
Fresh wontons for sale.

09:11.319 --> 09:13.040
Kites for sale.

09:13.120 --> 09:15.839
Take a look. Kites for sale.

09:20.319 --> 09:21.879
You darned wretch!

09:25.400 --> 09:26.839
Darned wretch!

09:27.120 --> 09:30.040
Who are you? How dare you
pit yourself against our prime minister?

09:31.359 --> 09:33.740
I'm indebted to Prime Minister Lin.

09:33.760 --> 09:35.760
Today, I shall repay his favor!

09:38.640 --> 09:39.720
Take him down!

09:54.400 --> 09:55.959
After him! Don't let him escape!

10:02.000 --> 10:03.199
That was scary.

10:03.880 --> 10:05.239
That was terrifying.

10:09.400 --> 10:12.470
Mr. Yan, this is evidence
that they're trying to silence us.

10:21.400 --> 10:22.560
Were you hurt?

10:25.840 --> 10:27.819
The Imperial Inspectorate's reputation
is widely known.

10:27.839 --> 10:29.860
We can rest at ease

10:29.880 --> 10:31.470
when you and your subordinates
are here, Mr. Yan.

10:31.479 --> 10:33.580
Mr. Yan, I think that was Yuan Hongdao.

10:33.600 --> 10:34.820
He's Prime Minister Lin's retainer.

10:34.840 --> 10:36.239
Do away with your doubts.

10:36.760 --> 10:38.030
That was him indeed.

10:44.319 --> 10:45.680
Do they treat people

10:46.640 --> 10:48.359
like livestock nowadays?

10:49.633 --> 10:50.920
You may leave.

10:56.559 --> 10:58.520
Mr. Yuan tried to
assassinate the victims?

10:59.839 --> 11:01.640
He failed to do so.

11:03.679 --> 11:05.599
This accusation will surely stick.

11:07.959 --> 11:09.640
Indeed.

11:12.240 --> 11:16.280
Mr. Yuan has served me for many years.

11:17.800 --> 11:19.339
I can't prove my innocence.

11:19.359 --> 11:22.079
Why did Mr. Yuan do so?

11:23.599 --> 11:25.400
I thought you would

11:25.599 --> 11:27.479
ask me

11:28.079 --> 11:30.220
whether I was the mastermind or not.

11:30.240 --> 11:31.920
You're not dumb, Mr. Lin.

11:33.800 --> 11:35.920
This is truly unexpected.

11:37.520 --> 11:39.260
Mr. Yuan has served me

11:39.280 --> 11:41.020
for so many years.

11:41.040 --> 11:42.920
He had a hidden agenda all along.

11:43.000 --> 11:44.900
I couldn't tell at all.

11:44.920 --> 11:46.599
Who exactly does he serve?

11:47.760 --> 11:50.280
That no longer matters.

12:09.120 --> 12:10.020
Sir, where are we going?

12:10.040 --> 12:11.120
Xinyang.

13:30.679 --> 13:31.800
Continue.

13:31.959 --> 13:32.860
No need to stop.

13:32.880 --> 13:33.960
Yes, sir.

14:07.240 --> 14:08.540
He was heading to Xinyang?

14:08.560 --> 14:10.320
That's Eldest Princess's territory.

14:11.719 --> 14:14.760
So, Yuan Hongdao was serving
Eldest Princess?

14:15.880 --> 14:18.819
Fan Xian's investigating the case
while Eldest Princess is the perpetrator.

14:18.839 --> 14:21.280
No matter what,
it's related to other people.

14:21.439 --> 14:23.400
It has nothing to do with him.

14:24.719 --> 14:27.830
Mr. Fan, I'll take it
as the conversation never happened.

14:30.760 --> 14:33.479
Even if you remember
the conversation, I'll deny it.

14:38.520 --> 14:41.900
Mr. Chen, the Black Cavalries were
already on his tail.

14:41.920 --> 14:43.699
Aren't we going to arrest Yuan Hongdao?

14:43.719 --> 14:45.959
Prime Minister Lin is
heading to the palace now.

14:47.160 --> 14:48.800
Fan Xian is joining him too.

14:50.160 --> 14:52.199
Why is he so nosy?

14:53.679 --> 14:55.359
No choice.

14:55.880 --> 14:57.520
It may appear like

14:57.630 --> 15:00.280
Fan Xian is sacrificing his family
for the greater good here.

15:00.920 --> 15:03.980
He's detaining Lin Ruofu
and bringing him to His Majesty himself.

15:04.000 --> 15:05.740
Lin Ruofu has been
an official for many years.

15:05.760 --> 15:07.440
He has plenty of proteges.

15:08.800 --> 15:10.400
Now,

15:11.199 --> 15:12.800
all of them will hate Fan Xian.

15:12.820 --> 15:14.120
There's no need to fear.

15:14.199 --> 15:15.460
I have plenty of haters too.

15:15.480 --> 15:17.160
Are you aware of the age difference
between you two?

15:17.160 --> 15:18.240
How could you compete with him?

15:18.240 --> 15:19.800
There's no need to fear.

15:21.080 --> 15:24.119
Prime Minister Lin has seen all kinds
of situations in the past decade or two.

15:24.199 --> 15:26.199
He understands the situation perfectly.

15:28.959 --> 15:30.400
It has already come to this.

15:30.439 --> 15:32.680
Can Prime Minister Lin
still protect himself?

15:32.719 --> 15:34.440
He has plenty of choices.

15:47.920 --> 15:49.199
Fan Xian,

15:49.559 --> 15:50.939
when we see His Majesty later,

15:50.959 --> 15:53.800
do not respond no matter what I say.

15:53.920 --> 15:55.339
Take it as if you didn't hear anything.

15:55.359 --> 15:57.140
Why don't I stay outside, then?

15:57.160 --> 15:58.359
That won't do.

15:58.439 --> 15:59.800
You have to be there for it.

15:59.959 --> 16:01.550
If we can arrest Yuan Hongdao

16:01.570 --> 16:03.590
and make him confess that he did it
under someone else's instruction,

16:03.599 --> 16:05.040
maybe we still stand a chance.

16:05.850 --> 16:08.220
The Imperial Inspectorate
would've arrested him long ago

16:08.240 --> 16:10.440
if they intended to do so.

16:10.800 --> 16:13.740
Sirs, I'm still here, you know?

16:13.760 --> 16:16.839
Just tell His Majesty
what we said word for word.

16:17.000 --> 16:19.079
Only then will we appear honest.

16:19.160 --> 16:22.339
Sirs, you two could've spoken in private.

16:22.359 --> 16:25.079
Those who are fair and just
need no private conversations.

16:32.719 --> 16:34.680
What did I say just now?

16:34.920 --> 16:36.599
When we see His Majesty later,

16:36.640 --> 16:39.160
I shouldn't respond
no matter what you say.

16:39.640 --> 16:42.040
If His Majesty wants you
to express your stand,

16:42.400 --> 16:43.999
just pretend to be ignorant.

16:44.520 --> 16:46.100
Prime Minister Lin.

16:46.120 --> 16:47.440
I'm an honest man.

16:47.559 --> 16:48.839
I have nothing to fear.

16:50.470 --> 16:51.999
Do you remember everything?

16:54.599 --> 16:56.539
Next, you have
to observe the show closely

16:56.559 --> 16:59.380
and learn from it.

16:59.400 --> 17:00.680
In the future,

17:01.280 --> 17:04.040
you'll be acting together
with His Majesty.

17:20.680 --> 17:21.859
Your Majesty.

17:21.879 --> 17:24.399
Prime Minister Lin
and Mr. Fan have arrived.

17:27.480 --> 17:28.120
Hurry!

17:28.140 --> 17:29.859
Grant Prime Minister Lin a seat already.

17:29.879 --> 17:30.780
Prime Minister Lin,

17:30.800 --> 17:33.260
I've read plenty of memorandums
in the past few days.

17:33.280 --> 17:35.819
Everyone in the Qing State
is doing their part.

17:35.839 --> 17:38.099
It shows a scene of thriving prosperity.

17:38.119 --> 17:39.579
It's all thanks to you.

17:39.599 --> 17:41.359
You've contributed much to this.

17:48.599 --> 17:49.800
Well...

17:50.480 --> 17:52.200
Did I bump into it?

17:56.520 --> 17:57.839
Prime Minister Lin,

17:57.960 --> 17:59.040
have a seat.

18:02.919 --> 18:04.700
I'm old now.

18:04.720 --> 18:06.679
I can't see clearly.

18:07.079 --> 18:10.599
Your Majesty,
I've offended you by accident.

18:10.919 --> 18:14.079
Please punish me.

18:14.599 --> 18:16.130
I've already said it just now.

18:16.150 --> 18:18.560
Prime Minister Lin, you've
contributed much to the state.

18:18.760 --> 18:20.720
Why should I punish you?

18:20.839 --> 18:23.099
Your Majesty, with the way you treat me,

18:23.119 --> 18:26.520
I can never repay your kindness
even with my death.

18:27.480 --> 18:31.825
What I meant was it wasn't enough
even if I die 100 times.

18:31.845 --> 18:34.566
It's not that my death would be in vain.

18:34.773 --> 18:38.139
Why are you talking about death
all of a sudden?

18:38.159 --> 18:39.560
We're humans.

18:39.605 --> 18:41.925
That day will eventually arrive.

18:42.280 --> 18:44.365
Prime Minister Lin,
you're at your prime now.

18:45.520 --> 18:47.240
It's too early for you to say that.

18:54.840 --> 18:56.119
Prime Minister Lin,

18:56.559 --> 18:58.079
I'm afraid you came here

18:58.206 --> 18:59.560
for a different reason

19:00.040 --> 19:02.119
than what you usually do here.

19:06.960 --> 19:08.280
Your Majesty,

19:09.079 --> 19:10.099
I

19:10.119 --> 19:11.679
have sinned!

19:12.800 --> 19:14.599
Get up and speak.

19:17.680 --> 19:18.800
Your Majesty,

19:19.319 --> 19:23.240
all these years have taken a toll on me.

19:23.359 --> 19:25.059
I'm physically and mentally drained.

19:25.079 --> 19:29.480
Now, my hair is white,
and I'm plagued by ailments.

19:29.720 --> 19:32.960
I have no way to tend
to state affairs again.

19:33.240 --> 19:35.180
I can't rest at ease
since I'm receiving a wage

19:35.200 --> 19:38.240
without doing anything.

19:38.280 --> 19:41.520
Your Majesty, please allow me

19:42.000 --> 19:44.240
to retire and return to my hometown.

19:48.839 --> 19:51.359
Plagued by ailments?

19:53.879 --> 19:54.440
Fan Xian.

19:54.440 --> 19:55.679
Yes, Your Majesty.

19:56.240 --> 19:59.320
Do you think Prime Minister Lin
is telling the truth?

20:01.480 --> 20:03.859
Your Majesty, I'm too young.

20:03.879 --> 20:05.099
I can't tell.

20:05.119 --> 20:07.119
Aren't you a medical practitioner?

20:07.159 --> 20:08.330
I'm a poison practitioner.

20:08.350 --> 20:09.960
Do you know how to read pulses?

20:10.159 --> 20:11.020
I do.

20:11.040 --> 20:13.579
Come. Read Prime Minister Lin's pulse.

20:13.599 --> 20:15.480
See if he's plagued by ailments.

20:40.399 --> 20:41.760
Your Majesty,

20:42.440 --> 20:44.040
it's not that bad.

20:44.760 --> 20:46.480
What do you mean by that?

20:46.599 --> 20:49.280
I can't detect any abnormalities
from his pulse.

20:50.200 --> 20:53.560
Growing old is considered an ailment.

20:59.399 --> 21:00.720
Prime Minister Lin.

21:03.879 --> 21:06.960
Didn't you say you were
plagued by ailments?

21:12.359 --> 21:14.599
Your Majesty,
I bumped into the chair just now.

21:14.599 --> 21:16.960
You witnessed it too.

21:17.200 --> 21:19.520
My eyes are no longer working.

21:19.960 --> 21:21.159
Fan Xian,

21:21.559 --> 21:23.339
what if my eyes aren't working?

21:23.359 --> 21:25.500
Can you tell that from reading my pulse?

21:25.520 --> 21:26.960
No.

21:28.480 --> 21:31.180
Your Majesty, I apologize
for breaching the etiquette just now.

21:31.200 --> 21:32.940
I would've been sentenced to death

21:32.960 --> 21:35.119
had it not for my eye disease.

21:35.399 --> 21:37.059
As leaves fall back to their roots,

21:37.079 --> 21:38.879
I humbly request

21:38.960 --> 21:42.359
my bones be laid to rest in my hometown.

21:43.480 --> 21:44.720
Prime Minister Lin,

21:45.839 --> 21:48.059
you've worked hard
and contributed to our state.

21:48.079 --> 21:49.619
If you leave now,

21:49.639 --> 21:51.839
I'm afraid all of the officials

21:52.559 --> 21:54.260
will quit as well.

21:54.280 --> 21:56.359
Your Majesty, you're wrong.

21:56.520 --> 21:59.960
I've been a top-ranking official
all these years.

22:00.280 --> 22:02.700
I've enjoyed fame and fortune.

22:02.720 --> 22:05.240
It's my duty to serve the state.

22:05.686 --> 22:07.700
I dare not claim credit for my work.

22:07.720 --> 22:09.399
I'm already lucky enough

22:09.520 --> 22:11.520
that I haven't been penalized
for my mistakes.

22:12.119 --> 22:13.879
You rendered both merit and mistakes.

22:14.399 --> 22:16.240
They cancel out each other.

22:16.280 --> 22:18.500
I can't afford
to accumulate mistakes at this age.

22:18.520 --> 22:21.919
Your Majesty,
please grant me permission to leave.

22:28.240 --> 22:30.639
I can't bear to part with you.

22:31.079 --> 22:32.200
Your Majesty,

22:32.800 --> 22:34.859
I'm moved to tears by your kind words.

22:34.879 --> 22:36.619
If you do leave,

22:36.639 --> 22:39.420
who else can replace you
as the next prime minister?

22:39.440 --> 22:41.320
It's an important position.

22:41.720 --> 22:44.839
Your Majesty, please make your own call.

22:45.119 --> 22:46.199
I dare not

22:46.319 --> 22:48.000
speak casually.

22:48.720 --> 22:51.379
But when I look around
at the civil and military officials,

22:51.399 --> 22:54.399
I'm afraid no one can match

22:54.440 --> 22:56.980
your knowledge and vision.

22:57.000 --> 22:59.119
Indeed.

22:59.440 --> 23:01.730
If someone were to be better than me,

23:01.750 --> 23:03.139
I wouldn't have been the prime minister

23:03.159 --> 23:06.760
all these years.

23:07.440 --> 23:10.359
If I said someone could replace me,

23:10.440 --> 23:12.439
what does that mean?

23:13.960 --> 23:16.420
That means I had made a wrong decision
by making you the prime minister.

23:16.440 --> 23:18.079
Indeed.

23:18.280 --> 23:20.879
Your Majesty,
your insight is impeccable.

23:21.040 --> 23:23.420
You would never be wrong
about an individual.

23:23.440 --> 23:27.359
Prime Minister Lin, that's why
you must remain as the prime minister.

23:27.480 --> 23:30.599
It's a shame that I've grown old.

23:31.399 --> 23:33.819
Your Majesty, don't worry.

23:33.839 --> 23:35.500
Once I retire,

23:35.520 --> 23:39.359
you may take your time
to find and select the next candidate.

23:39.440 --> 23:42.980
I'm sure you can find the best candidate

23:43.000 --> 23:45.079
to lead the other officials.

23:51.190 --> 23:52.439
Prime Minister Lin,

23:53.000 --> 23:54.639
you have

23:54.800 --> 23:56.480
plenty of proteges.

23:57.480 --> 24:00.159
Which of them is able
to handle important roles?

24:00.440 --> 24:02.220
Can you prepare a name list for me

24:02.240 --> 24:05.099
so that I can promote them
in the future?

24:05.119 --> 24:08.280
Your Majesty, I'm a just official.

24:08.680 --> 24:10.480
I don't do that.

24:12.520 --> 24:15.599
So, Prime Minister Lin,
you know this trick as well, huh?

24:15.639 --> 24:16.839
I dare not do so.

24:17.680 --> 24:21.359
Your Majesty, your judgment
is 100 times better than mine.

24:21.520 --> 24:23.800
I dare not do so.

24:27.040 --> 24:28.720
When will you leave?

24:28.800 --> 24:30.679
I'll leave the Capital immediately.

24:32.280 --> 24:34.559
Fan Xian will hold his wedding
with Wan'er very soon.

24:34.559 --> 24:35.980
Aren't you going
to wait a little longer?

24:36.000 --> 24:39.299
No. I'm bent on
returning to my hometown.

24:39.319 --> 24:40.599
What a shame.

24:41.520 --> 24:44.379
Prime Minister Lin, may I know

24:44.399 --> 24:47.200
if you'll return to your hometown alone?

24:57.960 --> 24:59.980
Just as you wish, Your Majesty.

25:00.000 --> 25:01.119
I shall

25:01.480 --> 25:03.359
return to my hometown alone.

25:04.800 --> 25:08.159
My son is mentally challenged.

25:08.200 --> 25:10.159
The trip to my hometown

25:10.440 --> 25:11.730
is long and arduous.

25:11.750 --> 25:12.919
I'm afraid he might get into trouble.

25:12.919 --> 25:14.240
Therefore,

25:14.919 --> 25:16.720
I won't take my son

25:17.079 --> 25:18.679
with me.

25:20.639 --> 25:21.839
Fan Xian.

25:23.480 --> 25:26.220
Dabao is close to you.

25:26.240 --> 25:28.619
Please look after him.

25:28.639 --> 25:31.879
I'll send him to your house tomorrow.

25:32.280 --> 25:35.240
Of course, I won't let you
work for nothing.

25:35.280 --> 25:37.680
I've included all of the expenses here.

25:37.680 --> 25:39.099
You don't need to do that.

25:39.119 --> 25:41.560
You must make sure he eats well.

25:41.839 --> 25:44.960
His Majesty is my witness here.

25:48.559 --> 25:49.720
Prime Minister Lin.

25:52.399 --> 25:53.879
Let me see you off.

25:59.559 --> 26:00.879
Your Majesty.

26:17.159 --> 26:19.000
That old fox.

26:20.599 --> 26:22.839
He set up a trap before leaving.

26:40.390 --> 26:42.460
Mr. Lin, will you truly retire
and return to your hometown?

26:42.480 --> 26:44.060
In the metropolitan exam name list,

26:44.080 --> 26:46.260
Yang Wanli's name was
replaced with someone else's.

26:46.280 --> 26:48.000
What happened in the end?

26:49.520 --> 26:51.079
Guo Zheng, the Minister of Rites,

26:51.200 --> 26:53.730
was demoted by His Majesty
and was sent to Jiangnan.

26:53.750 --> 26:55.780
Although a corruption case occurred
during the spring exam,

26:55.800 --> 26:57.839
only Guo Zheng was demoted.

26:58.559 --> 27:01.040
Can this be seen as an unresolved case?

27:01.359 --> 27:03.879
Actually, there's only one ending.

27:04.319 --> 27:07.119
He wanted you to investigate
the past corruption cases

27:07.559 --> 27:10.200
and use the murder case
to see me off on my last journey.

27:10.399 --> 27:12.780
Seems like His Majesty wanted

27:12.800 --> 27:14.720
to replace the prime minister long ago.

27:16.599 --> 27:18.480
So he did everything

27:19.010 --> 27:20.480
just so he could replace you?

27:35.639 --> 27:38.720
Indeed.

27:42.079 --> 27:43.879
I was thinking to myself

27:44.359 --> 27:48.200
why he insisted on making you
the Middle Examiner.

27:48.319 --> 27:50.800
Now, I finally understand.

27:51.680 --> 27:55.040
In the end, I was the target
for the spring exam.

27:55.240 --> 27:57.180
Chengze thought that he had set you up.

27:57.200 --> 28:01.200
In the end, His Majesty
just made him stand out from the crowd.

28:01.919 --> 28:04.879
His Majesty seized the opportunity
without leaving a trace.

28:05.520 --> 28:08.520
His Majesty's skillful use
of leveraging strength

28:09.040 --> 28:11.520
to achieve his goals is truly masterful.

28:13.639 --> 28:15.960
You have to learn from him.

28:17.760 --> 28:19.480
This is too difficult.

28:19.520 --> 28:21.200
I'm afraid
I won't be able to pick it up.

28:22.639 --> 28:25.320
Actually, it isn't that difficult?

28:25.399 --> 28:26.460
To put it bluntly,

28:26.480 --> 28:28.379
the relationship between
rulers and officials

28:28.399 --> 28:29.859
is just like a theatrical performance.

28:29.879 --> 28:32.619
The acting must be genuine,
and the heart must be stable.

28:32.639 --> 28:34.379
That is all.

28:34.399 --> 28:35.919
Let me give you a test.

28:37.520 --> 28:39.099
Why did His Majesty

28:39.119 --> 28:42.320
want me to give him
a name list of my proteges?

28:44.480 --> 28:46.060
You've been the prime minister
for many years.

28:46.080 --> 28:47.619
You have a wide network of contacts.

28:47.639 --> 28:48.580
By giving him the name list,

28:48.600 --> 28:49.919
he'll be able to avoid your influence

28:49.919 --> 28:51.760
when he selects the next prime minister.

28:51.839 --> 28:55.200
That's why I can't afford
to give it to him.

28:57.040 --> 28:58.800
My network of contacts

28:59.399 --> 29:02.079
is my foothold.

29:02.240 --> 29:04.200
As long as I don't hand
my trump card to him,

29:04.520 --> 29:07.599
I'll still have a chance
to return to the Capital.

29:08.240 --> 29:10.339
If so, wouldn't His Majesty
force you to give it to him?

29:10.359 --> 29:12.800
This is what I meant just now.

29:12.980 --> 29:14.780
The relationship between
rulers and their subjects

29:14.800 --> 29:16.460
is just like a game of weiqi.

29:16.480 --> 29:17.839
You must be calm during the match.

29:17.839 --> 29:19.830
And, you must be decisive
when you make a move.

29:22.399 --> 29:25.180
Everyone understands what's going on.

29:25.200 --> 29:27.079
I would have no idea

29:27.480 --> 29:29.240
if you didn't explain it to me.

29:30.240 --> 29:32.439
Let me test you again.

29:32.680 --> 29:35.359
Why did I leave Dabao behind?

29:36.680 --> 29:37.660
For my sake?

29:37.680 --> 29:39.200
All these years,

29:39.319 --> 29:41.839
I've established plenty of connections.

29:42.800 --> 29:44.520
Once I leave,

29:44.639 --> 29:47.679
my proteges might be upset with you.

29:48.760 --> 29:51.940
You were the cause
of this case after all.

29:51.960 --> 29:53.800
However, such matters

29:54.639 --> 29:57.240
are difficult to explain.

29:57.480 --> 30:00.420
There's no need to explain myself
if I keep Dabao at my residence.

30:00.440 --> 30:03.339
His Majesty wants you to chase me away

30:03.359 --> 30:05.960
so that you can become a lone subject.

30:17.480 --> 30:18.339
I understand.

30:18.359 --> 30:19.839
As if!

30:21.200 --> 30:22.700
What His Majesty desires

30:22.720 --> 30:24.280
isn't what you desire.

30:28.839 --> 30:31.159
What's the most thrilling thing

30:32.760 --> 30:35.040
about being a subject?

30:35.399 --> 30:38.280
It's engaging His Majesty in a match.

30:51.559 --> 30:53.619
I've lost the match.

30:53.639 --> 30:55.119
Next,

30:55.440 --> 30:56.960
it's your turn.

30:56.960 --> 30:57.660
Mr. Lin.

30:57.680 --> 30:58.859
Lower your volume.

30:58.879 --> 31:01.639
That's enough. I'm going to leave soon.

31:01.680 --> 31:03.679
It's okay for me to laugh out loud.

31:06.639 --> 31:08.379
What about the murder case, then?

31:08.399 --> 31:09.960
What murder case?

31:10.119 --> 31:12.200
There's no murder case!

31:35.319 --> 31:37.560
He Zongwei, receive the imperial edict.

31:46.440 --> 31:50.539
According to His Majesty's oral edict,
as a scholar, He Zongwei

31:50.559 --> 31:52.299
he excels in talent, virtue,

31:52.319 --> 31:54.139
and wisdom.

31:54.159 --> 31:55.780
He's a rare talent.

31:55.800 --> 31:57.500
Thus, an exception shall be made.

31:57.520 --> 31:59.379
He shall be exempted
from the imperial examination

31:59.399 --> 32:02.619
and assume the post of a censor
in the Imperial Procuratorate.

32:02.639 --> 32:04.879
He shall assume his post immediately.

32:05.639 --> 32:08.960
Long live Your Majesty!

32:09.200 --> 32:10.839
Do your part well.

32:11.200 --> 32:13.520
His Majesty expects
great things from you.

32:16.559 --> 32:18.439
I'm willing to devote my heart and soul

32:18.639 --> 32:20.200
and risk my life

32:20.520 --> 32:22.359
to serve His Majesty!

32:41.040 --> 32:42.159
Everyone,

32:42.359 --> 32:43.839
get up.

32:44.319 --> 32:45.480
Please get up.

32:46.520 --> 32:47.919
All of you, please get up.

32:54.119 --> 32:55.299
Go now.

32:55.319 --> 32:57.460
Let's go back. That was terrifying.

32:57.480 --> 32:58.599
Mr. Yan,

32:59.119 --> 33:00.859
from now on, we're fellow officials.

33:00.879 --> 33:02.140
Please look after me.

33:02.919 --> 33:05.590
We should at least head
to the Court of Judicial Bureau first.

33:05.800 --> 33:07.240
What do you mean?

33:08.559 --> 33:10.280
A murder trial is awaiting us.

33:11.599 --> 33:12.879
Did you forget about it?

33:12.919 --> 33:14.539
Mr. Yan, I'm dropping the charges.

33:14.559 --> 33:16.639
What do you take our laws
and regulations for?

33:17.200 --> 33:18.679
Mr. Yan, you misunderstood me.

33:22.639 --> 33:23.719
Mr. Yan,

33:23.910 --> 33:26.520
it's just that the widow
is grieving excessively for her husband.

33:27.480 --> 33:29.040
She's unable to continue.

33:29.879 --> 33:31.720
Just like what Mr. He had said,

33:32.800 --> 33:34.599
I'll stop pressing charges.

33:35.000 --> 33:36.080
Look.

33:39.159 --> 33:40.839
This case concerns one's life.

33:42.280 --> 33:43.839
How could we joke around?

33:43.910 --> 33:45.760
Mr. Yan, you're taking it too seriously.

33:45.810 --> 33:47.520
We haven't established a case
in the magistrate yet.

33:47.520 --> 33:48.420
We didn't go against the law.

33:48.440 --> 33:50.180
It's just that
we bothered Mr. Fan before this.

33:50.200 --> 33:52.839
I'll apologize to him personally later.

33:53.559 --> 33:55.000
Mr. Yan, please pardon us.

33:55.319 --> 33:58.679
Wontons for sale.

34:00.960 --> 34:02.040
Mr. Yan.

34:07.079 --> 34:08.159
What about this?

34:09.080 --> 34:12.990
I'll impeach myself
and request His Majesty's judgment.

34:13.080 --> 34:14.160
Is that okay?

34:18.080 --> 34:19.999
Someone tried
to assassinate you just now.

34:20.150 --> 34:21.770
Are you dropping the case as well?

34:26.270 --> 34:28.080
When one has the opportunity to forgive,

34:28.200 --> 34:29.600
one should be magnanimous.

34:30.399 --> 34:31.640
What do you think?

34:37.230 --> 34:38.880
Let's return to the First Division.

34:41.720 --> 34:43.720
Farewell, Mr. Yan.

35:30.479 --> 35:33.080
Why did they leave all of a sudden?

35:34.879 --> 35:37.380
That means the negotiation
in the Capital is over.

35:37.400 --> 35:38.660
They tailed us for the entire journey.

35:38.680 --> 35:40.400
I thought they were going to arrest us.

35:41.240 --> 35:43.399
They'd arrest us
had the negotiation gone south.

35:43.560 --> 35:45.399
That means we're fine now.

35:46.120 --> 35:47.640
We're fine for today.

35:48.880 --> 35:50.770
But who knows
what'll happen in the future?

35:57.959 --> 35:59.160
Ruohai.

35:59.319 --> 36:00.399
The axle.

36:00.640 --> 36:01.720
The axle.

36:02.640 --> 36:04.200
The axle is breaking down.

36:05.804 --> 36:08.260
Can't you instruct
your subordinates to fix it?

36:08.280 --> 36:09.979
I can't leave it to outsiders.

36:09.999 --> 36:11.899
Don't tell me
someone will try to steal it?

36:11.919 --> 36:14.180
No one else can touch this.

36:14.200 --> 36:15.280
But why?

36:15.519 --> 36:17.160
There's a secret inside.

36:19.160 --> 36:21.100
It's just a chair with two wheels.

36:21.120 --> 36:22.959
What kind of secret can you hide inside?

36:23.560 --> 36:26.039
Mr. Fan, lend me a hand.

36:38.519 --> 36:39.620
It's done now, right?

36:39.640 --> 36:40.720
Ruohai.

36:41.319 --> 36:42.399
The other side.

36:43.120 --> 36:43.640
The other side?

36:43.640 --> 36:45.039
Are you not done yet?

36:45.479 --> 36:47.120
I'll pay you extra for it.

36:49.839 --> 36:52.200
Mr. Fan, sorry for the trouble again.

37:14.879 --> 37:17.720
Is that the end of the incident
with Lin Ruofu?

37:19.280 --> 37:20.704
He served as prime minister
for many years,

37:20.705 --> 37:22.580
and he's widely influential.

37:22.600 --> 37:24.520
What would you do
if you were in his shoes?

37:27.399 --> 37:29.320
That's how the imperial court is.

37:29.439 --> 37:32.200
And, you want Fan Xian
to take over the Imperial Inspectorate?

37:33.560 --> 37:34.879
He can handle it.

37:35.999 --> 37:36.940
Ruohai.

37:36.960 --> 37:38.399
The top side. That's right.

37:40.640 --> 37:42.479
Do you know

37:43.519 --> 37:45.240
who's supposed to retire next?

37:47.479 --> 37:48.879
Not you.

37:49.560 --> 37:52.359
Fan Xian is without a solid foundation.
You have to look after him.

37:53.959 --> 37:55.039
Mr. Fan,

37:55.680 --> 37:57.999
I need your help for this.

38:02.959 --> 38:04.039
Mr. Fan?

38:13.359 --> 38:16.800
I shouldn't have let Fan Xian
come to the Capital in the first place.

38:20.280 --> 38:22.680
That's something
both you and I cannot control.

38:30.839 --> 38:31.919
Mr. Chen,

38:32.519 --> 38:33.600
I'm done.

38:38.999 --> 38:41.399
Lin Ruofu overstayed his welcome
as the prime minister.

38:42.160 --> 38:43.499
Isn't it the same for you?

38:43.519 --> 38:45.060
Have you never thought

38:45.080 --> 38:46.600
of withdrawing while you can?

38:46.919 --> 38:49.519
There are some things
I haven't accomplished yet.

38:49.560 --> 38:50.640
What are they?

38:52.800 --> 38:54.439
I'll get you the money.

39:04.399 --> 39:06.760
You did a terrible job today.

39:09.839 --> 39:11.359
I can't enjoy myself

39:11.640 --> 39:13.080
when I have to play here.

39:25.080 --> 39:25.780
Dabao.

39:25.800 --> 39:26.880
Father.

39:27.519 --> 39:29.640
When you live with Fan Xian,

39:29.720 --> 39:31.200
you have to be a good boy.

39:31.440 --> 39:33.060
You need to address everyone
in the house.

39:33.080 --> 39:35.720
Father, don't worry. I'll be a good boy.

39:35.919 --> 39:38.879
You must tidy your clothing.

39:39.640 --> 39:41.320
You must stay clean.

39:41.560 --> 39:43.519
Don't argue with other people.

39:44.160 --> 39:46.479
If someone bullies you,

39:46.919 --> 39:49.200
just tell Fan Xian and Wan'er.

39:49.439 --> 39:50.559
Understood?

39:51.080 --> 39:52.019
Father, don't worry.

39:52.039 --> 39:53.819
They'll definitely help me out.

39:53.839 --> 39:55.120
Dabao,

39:55.519 --> 39:57.479
what I will say later

39:57.760 --> 39:59.600
might not make sense to you.

39:59.879 --> 40:01.640
But that's fine.

40:01.965 --> 40:04.445
You just need to remember it.

40:04.839 --> 40:06.240
Remember this.

40:07.240 --> 40:09.439
People will change.

40:09.560 --> 40:11.640
People will change?

40:11.720 --> 40:15.800
Therefore, no matter
what other people say to you,

40:16.280 --> 40:17.839
never believe their words.

40:17.999 --> 40:18.999
You just need to believe

40:18.999 --> 40:22.019
Fan Xian and Wan'er.

40:22.039 --> 40:23.320
Understood?

40:24.160 --> 40:27.479
I'll only believe
Little Xian and Wan'er.

40:27.919 --> 40:30.740
In the future, you should
only call him Little Xian

40:30.760 --> 40:32.280
in private.

40:32.800 --> 40:36.080
It's best not to call him that
when other people are around.

40:38.879 --> 40:41.640
I'm afraid Fan Xian
might be upset about it.

40:41.919 --> 40:44.019
Father, that won't happen.

40:44.039 --> 40:46.879
Little Xian won't be upset at me
because of that.

40:47.720 --> 40:50.879
Of course I believe Fan Xian and Wan'er.

40:51.240 --> 40:53.160
If not, I wouldn't...

40:56.080 --> 40:58.760
But, just in case,

41:00.080 --> 41:02.559
I'm saying this just in case.

41:03.399 --> 41:04.879
If, one day,

41:05.120 --> 41:08.720
they stop liking you as much,

41:09.240 --> 41:11.800
and they don't like
speaking to you as much,

41:12.640 --> 41:14.879
you should try to be quiet.

41:15.439 --> 41:17.859
You can talk to yourself

41:17.879 --> 41:19.999
and play on your own.

41:20.519 --> 41:22.559
Just stay over there

41:23.879 --> 41:25.760
and live at your own pace.

41:26.800 --> 41:28.399
It's as if you're playing a game

41:28.640 --> 41:31.959
where you're trying your best
not to bother other people.

41:32.879 --> 41:34.120
Understood?

41:35.200 --> 41:36.919
But why?

41:37.399 --> 41:38.559
Father,

41:38.959 --> 41:41.519
why would they stop liking me?

41:43.160 --> 41:45.479
I don't think that'll happen.

41:45.720 --> 41:47.959
I'm saying that just in case.

41:50.280 --> 41:51.439
I understand now.

41:51.560 --> 41:53.959
People will change.

41:55.200 --> 41:57.120
Dabao, you're such a smart boy.

41:58.680 --> 42:01.100
It's fine even if that day

42:01.120 --> 42:02.839
does come.

42:05.120 --> 42:06.600
In this world,

42:07.120 --> 42:10.559
no one is obliged to be nice to you.

42:11.519 --> 42:16.280
In this world,
no one is obliged to be nice to me.

42:17.080 --> 42:18.919
Except for me.

42:19.919 --> 42:21.640
Except for you.

42:22.039 --> 42:23.120
That's right.

42:23.319 --> 42:25.240
Except for me.

42:25.319 --> 42:26.786
Except for you.

42:26.806 --> 42:32.086
Except for you!

42:37.160 --> 42:38.240
All right now.

42:39.999 --> 42:41.660
Put the little things inside.

42:41.680 --> 42:42.419
Put them inside.

42:42.439 --> 42:42.979
Go now.

42:42.999 --> 42:44.919
Go to my father's place
and bring Dabao here.

42:45.720 --> 42:47.479
We should leave some space for Dabao.

42:49.120 --> 42:50.200
No!

42:52.200 --> 42:53.720
You can't touch that.

42:57.039 --> 42:59.039
Dabao is inside.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.876 --> 45:02.016
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
